    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "Campbells Auctioneers are delighted to present this spacious four-bedroom detached residence at Derrynamansher, Annagry, Co. Donegal to the open market.\n\nOccupying an elevated site, the property enjoys an attractive rural setting while remaining conveniently located close to Annagry Village and the many amenities available throughout the surrounding area. The world-famous Leo`s Tavern is also located close by, one of the area`s best-known landmarks and renowned for its strong connection to traditional Irish music.\n\nInternally, the property benefits from a generous and spacious layout, providing excellent accommodation across two floors.\n\nThe ground floor accommodation comprises an entrance hallway, living room, kitchen / dining room, utility room, two bedrooms, one of which benefits from en-suite facilities, a family bathroom and hall storage.\n\nUpstairs, there are a further two generously sized Attic Rooms, an upstairs bathroom and landing area.\n\nExternally, the property benefits from gardens to both the front and rear, providing ample outdoor space. A tin shed is located to the rear of the property and lends itself to a variety of uses, including general storage, workshop space or other practical purposes.\n\nViewing is highly recommended and is by appointment with Campbells Auctioneers.\n\nOur Ref: K1256"
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Accommodation",
        "SortOrder": 1,
        "Content": "Hallway - 6.29m (20'8\") x 4.47m (14'8\")\nTiled\n\nLiving Room - 4.25m (13'11\") x 3.69m (12'1\")\nLaminate Wood Floor, Solid Fuel Fire\n\nKitchen / Dining Room - 5.97m (19'7\") x 5.13m (16'10\")\nOpen Plan, Tiled, Fully Fitted\n\nUtility Room - 2.12m (6'11\") x 2m (6'7\")\nTiled, Fitted Units\n\nBedroom 1 (En Suite) - 3.52m (11'7\") x 3.38m (11'1\")\nLaminate Wood Floor\n\nEn Suite (Bed 1) - 2.08m (6'10\") x 0.96m (3'2\")\nTiled Floor, Shower, Hand Basin, Toilet\n\nBedroom 2 - 3.53m (11'7\") x 2.97m (9'9\")\nLaminate Wood Floor\n\nBathroom - 2.45m (8'0\") x 1.09m (3'7\")\nTiled Floor, Shower, Hand Basin, Toilet\n\nHall Storage - 2.67m (8'9\") x 0.91m (3'0\")\n\nLanding - 4.08m (13'5\") x 3.74m (12'3\")\nLaminate Wood Floor\n\nOffice - 4.24m (13'11\") x 4.08m (13'5\")\nLaminate Wood Floor\n\nStudy - 4.09m (13'5\") x 3.7m (12'2\")\nLaminate Wood Floor\n\nUpstairs Bathroom - 1.95m (6'5\") x 1.86m (6'1\")\nTiled Floor, Shower, Toilet, Hand Basin\n\nNotice\nPlease note we have not tested any apparatus, fixtures, fittings, or services. Interested parties must undertake their own investigation into the working order of these items. All measurements are approximate and photographs provided for guidance only."
